.DS_Store
# Anchored to the data directory by full path. Unanchored `corpus/` also matched
# packages/iconsmith/src/corpus/, so every new source file there was invisible to
# `git add` — record.ts, sources.ts and baselines.ts were all silently ignored
# until this was caught. A leading slash alone would anchor to the repo root,
# where no corpus/ exists, and ignore nothing.
/packages/iconsmith/corpus/
.scratch/
.staging/
# The record store: derived from the source trees, rebuilt by `corpus build`,
# and ~60 MB of it is float sidecars. Committed artifacts come from a later
# slice and will live somewhere else.
.corpus/
# A 492 KB minified TURBOPACK chunk scraped from centralicons.com for its icon
# metadata — third-party vendor code wearing a `.json` extension. The slugs it
# carries are already in `corpus/corpus.json` (2,085) and `.corpus/icons.jsonl`,
# so nothing needs it tracked, and publishing another set's bundle from an MIT
# repo is a provenance question `program.md` answers the other way. Anchored:
# a bare `central.json` would match at any depth.
/central.json

# Local render snapshots include private retrieved house-reference geometry.
/output/ten-icons-repaired-2026-09-09/*/revision.json
/output/ten-icons-repaired-2026-09-09/*/check-*/
